## Checklist

- [ ] `RequestStreamingPermissions` composable created
- [ ] `MainStreamScreen` gated behind permission check
- [ ] Permission denied state shows explanatory message
- [ ] Lifecycle observer handles pause/resume/destroy
- [ ] `StreamManager` emits error messages via `SharedFlow`
